              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Create and Run",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "npm create vite@latest my-app -- --template react-ts",
                "cd my-app",
                "npm install",
                "npm run dev"
              ],
              "note": "react-ts template"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Script",
                "Does"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`dev`",
                  "Server with ==HMR=="
                ],
                [
                  "`build`",
                  "`tsc`, then `vite build` into `dist/`"
                ],
                [
                  "`preview`",
                  "Serves built output locally"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Env, Config, Alias",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Env vars need the ==VITE_== prefix: `import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL`",
                "Unprefixed vars are {red:not exposed} to client code",
                "`server.proxy` forwards `/api` to the backend, avoiding ==CORS== in dev",
                "`@` alias needs ==both== `resolve.alias` and tsconfig `paths`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "typescript",
              "lines": [
                "export default defineConfig({",
                "  plugins: [react()],",
                "  resolve: { alias: { '@': '/src' } },",
                "  server: { proxy: { '/api': 'http://localhost:3000' } },",
                "})"
              ],
              "note": "vite.config.ts"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Type Checking and Entry",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Vite's transform only ==strips types==, never checks them",
                "Catch errors with `tsc -b --noEmit` or `npm run build`: bare `tsc` checks nothing in this template",
                "Entry is `index.html` at the project ==root==, not `public/`"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "text": "**Why no type errors in dev?** Types are only stripped. **Which prefix exposes env vars?** `VITE_`. **How avoid CORS in dev?** `server.proxy`."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
