          "title": "ESLint Rules for Hooks and DevTools",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Two Hook Rules",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Rule",
                "Level",
                "Catches"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`rules-of-hooks`",
                  "{red:error}",
                  "hook called in the wrong place"
                ],
                [
                  "`exhaustive-deps`",
                  "{orange:warn}",
                  "missing dependency in the array"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "javascript",
              "lines": [
                "import reactHooks from 'eslint-plugin-react-hooks'",
                "export default [reactHooks.configs.flat.recommended]"
              ],
              "note": "eslint.config.js (flat config) enables both rules"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Fixing Violations",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "rules-of-hooks",
              "items": [
                "Call hooks at the ==top level== of a component or custom hook",
                "Never in conditions, loops or nested functions",
                "Never after an early `return`",
                "Custom hook names must start with `use`"
              ],
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`exhaustive-deps` flags reactive values used in `useEffect`, `useCallback`, `useMemo` but missing from deps",
                "Fix: ==move the function inside the effect==, or wrap it in `useCallback`"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Never silence it",
              "text": "Do not disable `exhaustive-deps`. Fix the code instead."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. React DevTools",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Tab",
                "Use it to"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Components",
                  "inspect props, state, hooks; ==edit live==; search by name"
                ],
                [
                  "Profiler",
                  "record an interaction; read flamegraph and ranked chart"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{blue:Colored} bar = rendered; ==gray== bar = did not render",
                "Enable **Record why each component rendered** to see changed props, state or hooks",
                "**Highlight updates** shows needless re-renders"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
